<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<body style="margin:0;background:#f8fbff;color:#0b1220;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;">
    <div style="max-width:640px;margin:0 auto;padding:32px 20px;">
        <div style="border-radius:24px;background:#0b1220;padding:32px;color:#ffffff;">
            <p style="margin:0;color:#93c5fd;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:1.5px;text-transform:uppercase;">Pristine Web Consulting</p>
            <h1 style="margin:12px 0 0;font-size:28px;">Thanks for getting in touch, {{ name }}.</h1>
        </div>
        <div style="margin-top:16px;border:1px solid #dbeafe;border-radius:24px;background:#ffffff;padding:32px;line-height:1.6;">
            <p style="margin-top:0;">Your consultation request has been received. I’ll review the details and reply with the most useful next step.</p>
            <p>If you would like access to the client portal, you can create an account now.</p>
            <p style="margin:28px 0;text-align:center;"><a href="{{ register_url }}" style="display:inline-block;border-radius:12px;background:#2563eb;padding:14px 20px;color:#ffffff;font-weight:bold;text-decoration:none;">Create a client account</a></p>
            <p style="margin-bottom:0;color:#475569;font-size:14px;">Creating an account is optional and does not commit you to an engagement.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
